WEBVTT

00:28:28.570 --> 00:28:31.916
has helped him maintain his livelihood
during the pandemic.

00:28:31.940 --> 00:28:35.026
This kind of ingenuity is visible
in many service jobs.

00:28:35.050 --> 00:28:38.226
Some physical therapists
are doing virtual appointments.

00:28:38.250 --> 00:28:39.416
So are plumbers.

00:28:39.440 --> 00:28:41.407
Plumber: You know, as far as your toilet,

00:28:41.431 --> 00:28:43.319
what have you been flushing down there?

00:28:43.343 --> 00:28:46.405
Did you use a plunger for this,
because you really don't want to.

00:28:46.429 --> 00:28:48.173
Oh, I told him what tools he needed,

00:28:48.197 --> 00:28:51.118
and I stayed on the video with him
while he fixed it himself.

00:28:51.142 --> 00:28:53.256
It ended up being a very simple fix.

00:28:53.280 --> 00:28:55.297
AG: And people doing
more independent work

00:28:55.321 --> 00:28:57.284
have found creative ways to stay engaged

00:28:57.308 --> 00:28:58.526
while working from home.

00:28:58.550 --> 00:28:59.886
Woman: I fake my commute,

00:28:59.910 --> 00:29:04.726
which means I get on my stationary bike
and listen to a podcast